{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"导出前推"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"导出前推"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>导出前推是"},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"语境中的"},{"Local":{"url":"推前","text":"前推"}},{"Plain":"的一个"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"模型"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"前推","text":"直像"}},{"Plain":"函子 $f_*\\colon Mod(X,\\mathcal{O}_X)\\to Mod(Y,\\mathcal{O}_Y)$ 有右"},{"Local":{"url":"导出函子","text":"导出函子"}},{"Plain":" $Rf_*\\colon D(X,\\mathcal{O}_X)\\to D(Y,\\mathcal{O}_Y)$.</p>\n<p>设有"},{"Local":{"url":"内射消解","text":"内射消解"}},{"Plain":" $F\\to I^\\bullet$, 定义 $R^if_*F = H^i(f_*I^\\bullet)$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>到一个点上的导出前推是"},{"Local":{"url":"层上同调","text":"层上同调"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>对于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Noether概形","text":"Noether 概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$, $\\mathsf {Qcoh}(X)$ 有足够多内射对象.</p>\n<h3>高阶直像消失</h3>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 对于 $i&gt;\\dim X$, $R^i f_* \\mathcal F = 0$.</p>\n"}]}}